  "description": "<h3>What does this mod do?</h3>\n<p>This mod makes getting headshot more… headshotty, by instantly fading your screen to black when you get killed with a headshot.</p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/Tbd060N.gif\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Tbd060N.gif\" alt=\"Tbd060N.gif\" /></a></p>\n<h3>INSTALLATION</h3>\n<p>Like any other mod, just drag and drop the BepInEx folder into your SPT folder.</p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/wByb5Ln.gif\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/wByb5Ln.gif\" alt=\"wByb5Ln.gif\" /></a></p>\n",
